      "id": 192309,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-22T00:22:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So now we have a pretty good idea of the premise of the RPG: The PC's are mentees of an existing hero team (or perhaps represent different teams). &nbsp;Both Dark Watch and the Freedom Five take on \"apprentice\" heroes. &nbsp;I'm sure the Prime Wardens do as well. &nbsp;Void Guard... possibly. &nbsp;Idealist and Wraith aren't really the mentor types, but on the other hand, the Obliveon Shards are probably destroyed at that point, leaving the team significantly weakened.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:19:04.141Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
